WEBVTT

01:00.390 --> 01:07.220
It is said that 70% of the
human brain's capacity is unused.

01:09.230 --> 01:11.290
It's also thought that...

01:11.860 --> 01:15.060
...the mysterious powers that humans
have are hidden in this part of the brain.

01:17.000 --> 01:21.560
The 70% of the brain that is not used...

01:22.340 --> 01:24.070
...is often called this...

01:24.140 --> 01:29.880
<i>Night Head Genesis</i>

02:04.650 --> 02:05.640
Brother!

02:10.860 --> 02:12.590
Brother, come back! Brother!

02:12.660 --> 02:14.130
Naoto is dead.

02:15.130 --> 02:16.530
<i>Judgement by God</i>

02:16.530 --> 02:20.330
<i>Judgement by God
Episode 22</i>

02:49.190 --> 02:50.530
Please come back...

02:50.760 --> 02:52.560
Please don't leave me behind.

02:52.860 --> 02:53.690
Brother...

03:49.050 --> 03:52.180
I was able to get this far
because you were with me, Brother.

03:52.890 --> 03:55.190
There is a future to your powers.

03:55.390 --> 03:57.830
It's a power necessary
for something important.

03:57.900 --> 04:00.060
But my power is different.

04:00.230 --> 04:02.060
It's the power of destruction.

04:02.730 --> 04:04.220
No, Brother...

04:04.370 --> 04:06.340
I just sense things.

04:07.310 --> 04:10.240
I can't do anything
unless you are with me.

04:10.310 --> 04:11.610
I can't do anything!

04:16.650 --> 04:18.840
Mr. Mikuriya said before...

04:19.220 --> 04:21.410
"There isn't a power
that has no meaning."

04:21.490 --> 04:26.010
"There is definitely a
meaning behind our powers."

04:26.430 --> 04:29.950
But, I don't care about that anymore.

04:31.130 --> 04:31.960
Brother...

04:38.540 --> 04:39.400
Kirihara...

04:40.870 --> 04:42.310
Naoya Kirihara...

04:43.080 --> 04:45.440
Please, protect Sakie.

04:45.710 --> 04:49.340
If Sakie falls into Ark's hands...

04:49.410 --> 04:52.040
...the world will be destroyed.

04:52.550 --> 04:53.540
Naoya...

04:53.750 --> 04:57.120
Please... please take care of Sakie.

04:57.660 --> 04:59.420
Protect her from Ark.

05:01.760 --> 05:03.020
I can't!

05:03.130 --> 05:04.990
My brother's not coming back!

05:05.160 --> 05:07.460
It's impossible for me alone.

05:07.530 --> 05:09.360
Please, Naoya...

05:09.670 --> 05:11.900
Sakie Amamoto...

05:12.200 --> 05:13.500
Please save her...

05:13.810 --> 05:14.600
Save her...

05:17.810 --> 05:18.710
Please...

05:20.050 --> 05:21.030
Brother...

05:21.610 --> 05:23.510
What am I supposed to do?

05:23.780 --> 05:24.580
Brother...

05:24.650 --> 05:25.580
Naoya...

05:29.890 --> 05:30.910
Don't fear.

05:31.220 --> 05:32.520
You can do it.

05:33.090 --> 05:34.680
Please help Sakie...

05:35.260 --> 05:36.230
Brother...

05:40.670 --> 05:41.630
Naoya...

05:41.970 --> 05:43.430
You are not alone.

05:44.870 --> 05:47.100
I'm always inside of you.

05:48.010 --> 05:48.940
Naoya...

06:21.940 --> 06:22.840
Miss Sakie...

06:23.640 --> 06:24.730
Mr. Naoya...

06:24.980 --> 06:26.170
Where are you going?

06:26.880 --> 06:28.000
I'm going back home.

06:28.650 --> 06:32.410
Miss Okuhara told me to
see my family one more time.

06:33.150 --> 06:36.480
After I talk to Tomomi, I'm going
back to Miss Okuhara's place.

06:37.290 --> 06:38.190
Go back?

06:38.260 --> 06:39.250
Why?

06:39.720 --> 06:42.780
Because Miss Okuhara saved me.

06:43.500 --> 06:47.490
Thanks to her, I've become
so lighthearted for the first time.

06:48.070 --> 06:49.530
No, Miss Sakie.

06:49.600 --> 06:51.330
She's a scary person.

06:51.400 --> 06:53.100
Don't believe her.

06:57.440 --> 06:59.770
Mr. Naoya, why do
you say such a thing?

07:00.250 --> 07:03.270
Miss Sakie, this calm
right now isn't real.

07:03.350 --> 07:04.940
It's not going to last long.

07:05.020 --> 07:07.310
Don't listen to what
Okuhara tells you!

07:07.390 --> 07:08.750
Stop it!

07:12.320 --> 07:13.260
Miss Sakie!

07:26.100 --> 07:28.300
Brother, I'm going to go.

07:54.500 --> 07:56.870
We got a call from Mikumo.

07:57.000 --> 07:58.700
Everything has been taken care of.

07:59.970 --> 08:03.570
We are close to Sakie's
powers fully awakening.

08:04.080 --> 08:07.480
Yes. Along with a deep sorrow.

08:08.080 --> 08:11.880
A great number of people
are going to fall under her power.

08:12.120 --> 08:16.420
Then, Sakie's personality will vanish.

08:22.560 --> 08:23.620
I'm home!

08:24.230 --> 08:25.290
Dad!

08:26.600 --> 08:27.390
Mom!

08:29.430 --> 08:30.420
Tomomi!

08:31.270 --> 08:32.930
Your sister is home!

08:34.840 --> 08:35.860
Tomomi?

08:37.710 --> 08:40.200
Reformation is destruction.

08:41.410 --> 08:42.400
Tomomi?

08:42.480 --> 08:46.880
To stop that flow, we have
done a lot of different things.

08:47.650 --> 08:49.810
Your sister is home!

08:51.120 --> 08:52.090
Tomomi?

08:52.160 --> 08:54.820
The rest we'll just have to leave...

08:55.760 --> 08:56.750
Leave it?

08:56.860 --> 08:59.690
That's right. To the enormous flow...

08:59.930 --> 09:02.530
No one will be able
to stop it anymore.

09:03.070 --> 09:06.560
Do you think I am a cruel person?

09:07.270 --> 09:08.140
No.

09:16.410 --> 09:17.540
Tomomi...

09:17.880 --> 09:19.110
What has happened?

09:27.430 --> 09:28.150
It's coming.

09:40.610 --> 09:41.900
Miss Sakie...

09:43.910 --> 09:45.000
Ms. President...

09:45.380 --> 09:47.240
This is the great flow of power.

09:47.650 --> 09:49.440
Sakie's power.

10:17.810 --> 10:18.940
Miss Sakie!

10:27.550 --> 10:28.640
Miss Tomomi!

10:29.250 --> 10:30.920
Why did something like this happen?

10:33.060 --> 10:34.580
Miss Tomomi, don't die!

10:35.590 --> 10:36.720
Miss Tomomi!

10:36.800 --> 10:38.660
Come back, Miss Tomomi!

10:45.600 --> 10:46.540
Mikumo!

10:46.600 --> 10:48.400
I killed Tomomi.

10:48.470 --> 10:49.300
Why!

10:49.370 --> 10:51.970
To awaken Sakie.

10:54.310 --> 10:58.180
Sakie is showing the effect of her
powers more than I imagined.

11:01.220 --> 11:03.780
Naoya, even in a situation like this,
are you going to be able to...

11:03.860 --> 11:06.950
...stop yourself from throwing
your anger toward me?

11:09.330 --> 11:11.090
What's wrong? Don't you hate me?

11:11.160 --> 11:12.460
You can't forgive me, right?

11:12.530 --> 11:14.360
Come on, be enraged, Naoya!

11:14.830 --> 11:17.300
Throw your anger at me!

11:18.300 --> 11:19.860
What's wrong, Naoya?

11:26.780 --> 11:27.710
Why!

11:27.850 --> 11:29.370
Why don't you get enraged!

11:32.920 --> 11:34.650
Who do you think you are!

11:36.760 --> 11:38.690
Throw your anger at me, Naoya!

11:38.790 --> 11:39.760
Naoya!

11:41.030 --> 11:42.360
Brother...

11:49.300 --> 11:50.100
Enrage!

11:50.200 --> 11:51.670
Enrage, Naoya!

11:56.140 --> 11:58.670
Why? Why am I crying?

11:59.780 --> 12:02.650
Did I end up deeper in Naoya?

12:10.160 --> 12:12.850
Naoya, I'm disappointed in you.

12:24.300 --> 12:26.400
Wow, I was surprised.

12:26.600 --> 12:28.330
It's a tremendous power...

12:28.440 --> 12:30.460
25 km from the
company building to here.

12:30.540 --> 12:33.030
It has effected everyone in the area.

12:33.110 --> 12:35.440
Quit your rambling. Go!

12:35.650 --> 12:36.550
Y-Yes.

12:42.350 --> 12:44.080
Tomomi-san, I'm sorry.

12:44.920 --> 12:48.120
I wasn't able to save your sister.

12:50.160 --> 12:51.650
I'm powerless.

12:51.860 --> 12:53.960
I can't do anything alone.

12:55.200 --> 12:57.630
If my Brother isn't here,
I can't do anything.

12:58.940 --> 13:02.170
Brother, what should I do!

13:02.870 --> 13:04.710
Help me, Brother.

13:06.210 --> 13:07.300
Brother!

13:35.410 --> 13:36.960
I'm back, Mikumo!

13:40.680 --> 13:42.110
Naoto Kirihara.

13:42.350 --> 13:45.040
I went out of my way
to send you off to a more peaceful place.

13:45.150 --> 13:46.840
You still want to suffer?

13:46.950 --> 13:48.610
Just like what you said to me.

13:49.150 --> 13:51.140
To protect my little brother...

13:51.220 --> 13:53.320
I would become
a destroyer or even the devil...

13:53.390 --> 13:55.090
...and come back as
many times as I need to!

13:55.160 --> 13:56.130
You've got to be kidding.

13:56.190 --> 13:58.490
I will send you back
as many times as I need to!

14:06.170 --> 14:07.900
The uncertain data!

14:12.640 --> 14:13.670
Ms. President!

14:14.180 --> 14:15.240
This can't be...

14:15.310 --> 14:18.750
Is Naoto Kirihara a being that
can overcome my predictions?

14:40.040 --> 14:41.630
Naoto Kirihara!

14:41.710 --> 14:43.200
You are a murderer!

14:43.270 --> 14:45.710
Give me back my life!

15:04.030 --> 15:05.000
Naoto...

15:11.500 --> 15:13.800
Naoto, you came back.

15:14.570 --> 15:16.160
I was waiting for you.

15:16.840 --> 15:17.900
Naoto...

15:25.680 --> 15:27.120
How could you, Naoto?

15:32.460 --> 15:33.720
Brother...

15:33.860 --> 15:36.160
Don't do such a horrible thing to me.

15:38.430 --> 15:39.420
Brother...

15:43.200 --> 15:46.660
I was waiting for you to come back.

15:46.970 --> 15:49.340
But how could you, Brother?

15:56.150 --> 15:57.810
It hurts, Brother.

15:58.020 --> 15:59.210
Please stop.

15:59.380 --> 16:01.010
What happened to you?

16:01.820 --> 16:04.850
If you keep on going, I'll fall apart.

16:05.620 --> 16:07.560
How could you? How could you?

16:08.960 --> 16:11.160
You want me to break you too?

16:40.160 --> 16:44.030
I destroyed my parents'
consciousness without knowing it...

16:44.100 --> 16:46.460
...and pushed them
into committing suicide.

16:46.700 --> 16:48.530
That was when I was 17.

16:48.970 --> 16:52.090
Since then, I have killed many.

16:53.140 --> 16:55.130
It's all without noticing.

16:55.410 --> 16:58.930
My power is that
type of cursed power.

17:00.410 --> 17:02.470
For 15 years...

17:02.650 --> 17:05.620
...you were in a conservatory
or rather, a laboratory.

17:05.780 --> 17:11.950
If you weren't in the laboratory, you
most likely would have been like me.

17:12.360 --> 17:13.320
Mikumo...

17:13.830 --> 17:16.160
The time to stop
your suffering has come.

17:16.760 --> 17:19.090
I wanted to meet you earlier.

17:19.560 --> 17:24.020
A guy like you who
would destroy me...

17:40.450 --> 17:42.150
Mikumo has died.

17:50.930 --> 17:51.860
Sakie...

17:56.370 --> 17:57.230
Naoya...

17:57.500 --> 17:58.370
Where are you?

17:58.540 --> 17:59.370
Naoya...

18:00.070 --> 18:01.900
Please answer me, Naoya.

18:04.080 --> 18:04.800
Brother?

18:05.510 --> 18:07.070
Yeah, it's me.

18:07.480 --> 18:08.570
I'm back.

18:08.980 --> 18:10.740
You called me back.

18:11.480 --> 18:12.510
Brother...

18:12.880 --> 18:15.150
What's going on? Explain it to me.

18:17.920 --> 18:19.080
Miss Tomomi...

18:19.690 --> 18:22.160
Miss Tomomi was
murdered by Mikumo.

18:22.360 --> 18:23.120
What?

18:23.360 --> 18:26.560
Then Miss Sakie was taken away.

18:27.000 --> 18:28.930
I couldn't save her.

18:29.270 --> 18:30.790
I couldn't do anything.

18:31.100 --> 18:32.730
Nothing...

18:33.740 --> 18:37.230
I couldn't save or protect anyone.

18:52.020 --> 18:52.960
M-Miss Tomomi?

18:54.890 --> 18:55.720
Brother!

18:55.790 --> 18:57.660
Miss Tomomi is back!

18:58.030 --> 18:59.330
Miss Tomomi is...

18:59.830 --> 19:00.560
What?

19:00.670 --> 19:02.290
Miss Tomomi is alive!

19:04.640 --> 19:05.500
Sakie!

19:05.970 --> 19:06.700
Wake up!

19:06.770 --> 19:08.000
Your sister is alive!

19:08.170 --> 19:09.160
She's not dead!

19:09.310 --> 19:10.210
Sakie!

19:11.880 --> 19:13.570
Don't wake Sakie up!

19:35.230 --> 19:41.170
The only way to avoid conflict is
to unite all humanity together.

19:41.570 --> 19:45.130
If you do such a thing,
the distortion is going to become larger!

19:45.240 --> 19:47.970
As a result, there's going to be
an enormous conflict at the end!

19:48.050 --> 19:51.540
Regardless of how anything is,
humans will continue to fight.

19:51.750 --> 19:57.150
If it's for love and peace,
they will continue the fight for justice.

19:58.920 --> 20:02.380
As long as our materialistic
civilization continues...

20:02.460 --> 20:04.830
...humans will continue to fight.

20:13.840 --> 20:14.810
What's the matter?

20:15.010 --> 20:17.600
She is seeing
visions of her predictions.

20:23.910 --> 20:26.780
Naoto Kirihara, Naoya Kirihara...

20:27.180 --> 20:30.590
You two are no
longer uncertain data.

20:32.360 --> 20:36.520
You two overcame the
suffering I have brought to you...

20:36.590 --> 20:40.090
...and you gained stronger abilities.

20:40.160 --> 20:43.430
That is my job in this world.

20:46.070 --> 20:47.830
The great will...

20:47.910 --> 20:51.770
Thank you for benefiting from my life.

21:11.860 --> 21:14.490
Sakie's powers vanished.

21:15.070 --> 21:16.900
Okuhara has taken it.

21:17.570 --> 21:18.690
Thank you.

21:22.910 --> 21:24.770
Hey, get it together!

21:28.750 --> 21:29.970
I was...

21:30.980 --> 21:31.950
It's over.

21:32.080 --> 21:33.610
Everything is over.

21:35.090 --> 21:36.280
Sis!

21:38.690 --> 21:40.090
Tomomi!

21:42.230 --> 21:43.320
Sis!

21:44.360 --> 21:45.520
I'm so glad!

21:45.600 --> 21:46.720
I'm so glad you're okay!

21:46.800 --> 21:49.460
Sis, don't go anywhere again!

21:49.800 --> 21:52.000
I'll be with you forever, Tomomi.

21:52.170 --> 21:53.160
Sis...

21:55.110 --> 21:56.270
I'm so glad...

21:58.340 --> 21:59.330
Ms. President...

22:04.750 --> 22:07.270
There are no powers
without meaning.

22:07.350 --> 22:10.250
There is always a
meaning to a power.

22:10.490 --> 22:13.220
Also, there is a
reason for the suffering.

22:19.100 --> 22:21.060
Naoya Kirihara...

22:24.340 --> 22:26.390
For the next era...

22:31.240 --> 22:34.510
<i>An exact answer is nowhere.</i>

22:34.580 --> 22:37.170
<i>Even if you corner it, it still runs.</i>

22:37.250 --> 22:41.840
<i>It's that kind of repeating all the time.</i>

22:41.920 --> 22:45.150
<i>We hurt each other
and rip each other apart.</i>

22:45.220 --> 22:47.850
<i>We're complaining once again.</i>

22:47.930 --> 22:53.260
<i>When tomorrow comes, just like a lie,
you wear a mask and live on.</i>

22:53.330 --> 22:58.630
<i>I was wishing upon
the night stars...</i>

22:58.700 --> 23:03.970
<i>...for our distance
to become shorter.</i>

23:04.040 --> 23:10.670
<i>But if I try to bluff,
then I'm going to regret it.</i>

23:10.750 --> 23:13.220
<i>Words and feelings are reverse.</i>

23:13.280 --> 23:18.850
<i>Feelings that were asleep,
heart that was asleep, lure it out!</i>

23:18.920 --> 23:24.190
<i>Glamour that was asleep, myself
that was asleep, with your power!</i>

23:24.260 --> 23:29.720
<i>Please look at me quietly with the soul
that you cannot top more than this.</i>

23:29.800 --> 23:34.600
<i>I want you to go wilder inside me.</i>

23:34.670 --> 23:40.130
<i>Eyes that were asleep, emotions
that were asleep, wake them up!</i>

23:40.210 --> 23:45.480
<i>Memories that were asleep, dreams
that were asleep, with your power!</i>

23:45.550 --> 23:51.010
<i>Please melt me with the vision of kindness
that you cannot top more than this.</i>

23:51.090 --> 23:58.190
<i>I want to stay asleep
longer buried inside you.</i>

24:02.530 --> 24:05.590
The messiah that came down
to the mid-winter snowfield.

24:06.540 --> 24:09.870
The mysterious picture
the girl keeps on drawing.

24:11.180 --> 24:15.440
The largest and the
worst vision I have ever encountered.

24:16.250 --> 24:18.150
The sign that the
girl entrusts us with...

24:18.580 --> 24:20.950
What does it mean?

24:22.350 --> 24:29.850
<i>Episode 23, "Wandering"</i>

24:25.390 --> 24:28.690
Where are we headed?
